                <pb facs="0520" n="418" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg418"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.51/1851: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Munro</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-11-10T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 10,
                                1927—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>185. Your 307, October 31, 5 p.m. and despatch 504, October 13.<anchor n="30"
                        xml:id="d429-f1"/> Department approves your action and hopes to be able to
                    give further instructions shortly upon receiving study mentioned Department’s
                    181, November 5, 1 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
